@title Challenge lesson repaired by hand ends on Solved (1366x768)
@area Learn
@sizes 1366x768
# The Learn card is a pane of the right strip, so the sheet is centred 160 points further left than when the card floated; the Live window is moved aside first.
# Pin positions are for 1366x768 (at 1920x1080 the page panel moves the sheet), so this one runs at that size only.
# The lesson page opens on the whole sheet (a fit shows the sheet unless the drawing is twice as large close up, #1208), so the points are the pins at that zoom: the -K1 contact's top pin, a corner, the -S2 top pin.
key ctrl+k
wait 4
text hold in
wait 6
click_text "The motor will not hold in"
wait 40
key shift+l
wait 40
click_text Connect
wait 6
drag 150 90 760 90
wait 10
click 302 306
wait 4
move 285 306
wait 4
click 267 306
wait 10
shot repaired
click_text "Hold to press" #2
wait 20
shot after-start
click_text "Hold to press" #1
wait 40
shot end-solved
expect "Solved"
expect_not "Shown, not solved"
check_layout
